# A text-changing effect applies to the object it was created for; an object that leaves the battlefield and comes back is a
# new object (CR 400.7) with none of the old one's effects (CR 611.2c). Bot1's Mind Bend replaces Island with Swamp in Lord of
# Atlantis's text, so Bot1's Hullbreacher, a Merfolk, has swampwalk. Then Ephemerate exiles the Lord and returns it: the new
# Lord's text is the printed one, and the Hullbreacher has islandwalk again (and still +1/+1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Lord of Atlantis
Hullbreacher
Mind Bend
Ephemerate
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

